+What:		/sys/devices/platform/<platform>/fan_curve
+Description:
+		Local transactional fan curve for the exact validated platform:
+		Raider 18 HX AI A2XWIG, MS-1824, BIOS E1824IMS.310,
+		EC 1824EMS1.108, without firmware override or debug mode.
+
+		One line contains exactly 26 unsigned decimal bytes:
+		CPU temperatures[6], CPU speeds[7], GPU temperatures[6],
+		GPU speeds[7]. The driver establishes and verifies automatic
+		fan mode plus Cooler Boost, validates monotonicity and high-
+		temperature safety constraints, writes and reads back the whole
+		curve, and attempts full verified rollback on failure. It leaves
+		automatic mode plus Cooler Boost enabled after a write. Userspace
+		must explicitly select advanced mode or safely release Cooler
+		Boost after independent physical-RPM verification.
+
 What:		/sys/devices/platform/<platform>/fw_version
 Description:
 		Read-only, returns the version of the EC firmware.
